QwenOS licensing notice
=======================

QwenOS is dual-licensed by directory. Two license texts live in the repo root:
LICENSE (MIT) and COPYING (GPL-2.0).

MIT (see LICENSE): the QwenOS-original code
  kernel/, linker/, include/, tools/, tests/, docs/, Makefile,
  apps/ (except the doomd files listed below), ports/doom/

GPL-2.0-only (see COPYING): anything built on or modified from DMC100-Doom
(https://github.com/ArturBieniek4/DMC100-Doom, GPL-2.0), which descends from
doomgeneric and id Software's DOOM source (GPL-2.0)
  ports/doomdmc/, engine-patches/, apps/doomd.c, apps/doomd_crt0.S

The built /bin/doomd image links the GPL engine into the QwenOS memory layout, so
that binary, and any build that includes it, is GPL-2.0. The MIT parts remain MIT
when used on their own.

